		{"id":"a000000000000050","type":"text","text":"## Portfolio Distribution\n\n**APEX** (7/60 = 11%):\nKLA, TSM, ISRG, 2802, BESI, CSGP, NVDA\n\n**Fortress** (20/60 = 33%):\nINTU, AMAT, LRCX, ASMI, AEHR, EINK, WTC, GAW, AVGO, AIXA, FORM, NOW, VRT, DE, KAMBI, MRVL, VICR, IQE, 6981, LITE\n\n**Sticky Specialty** (11/60 = 18%):\nPLTR, CRWD, PANW, NET, SHOP, IOT, PSTG, APP, INTC, TTWO, SKM\n\n**Toll Operator** (10/60 = 16%):\n000660, META, AMD, DUOL, SPOT, NFLX, UBER, LNG, CCJ, CRCL\n\n**Commodity Trap** (12/60 = 20%):\n285A, SNDK, HIMS, MTN, PINS, STNG, OPEN, CRWV, BTC, GLD, RELIANCE, EDEL\n\n---\n\n**Reads from current distribution**:\n- ~11% of book in APEX — these are the multiples-don't-matter positions\n- ~45% in Fortress+APEX combined → pricing-power-tilted portfolio\n- ~20% in Commodity Trap → these positions must justify themselves on non-pricing grounds (cycle, asset value, balance sheet). Audit periodically.","x":5400,"y":200,"width":1400,"height":2400,"color":"5"},
